  "fullContentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">RPSC School Lecturer (Special) Recruitment 2026</h1>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-01T11:15:08+05:30\">June 1, 2026</time></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">11:15 am</span>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://rpsc.rajasthan.gov.in/home\">Rajasthan Public Service Commission (RPSC)</a>,</strong>&nbsp;has released <strong>a notification</strong> on its <strong>official website</strong> for the recruitment of <strong>RPSC School Lecturer (Special) Posts.&nbsp;</strong>This recruitment is for <strong>121 </strong>positions. <strong>RPSC Application Form</strong> has started on <strong>01 June 2026</strong> &amp; the candidates can apply till the <strong>30 June 2026</strong>. Minimum age required is <strong>21 Years &amp; The Maximum Age Is 40 Years as on 01 January 2027.</strong> Candidates must check the complete details for <strong>RPSC School Lecturer (Special)&nbsp;Recruitment 2026.</strong> which has given below. <strong>(<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Advt No 01/2026-27</span>)</strong></span></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Telegram </a></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">RPSC School Lecturer (Special) Online Form 2026 – Start</h2>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">RPSC School Lecturer (Special) Examination 2026 : Short Details</h3>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/rpsc-school-lecturer-special-2026/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Start Date : <strong>01 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>30 June 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Last Date For Fee Payment : <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>30 June 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Correction Date : <strong>10 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: #ffff00;\">Exam Date : 06 December 2026</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card :&nbsp;<strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Result Date : <strong>Will Be Updated Here Soon</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates are advised to confirm from the <strong>RPSC</strong><b>&nbsp;</b>official website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For<strong> General, Other State </strong>: <strong>₹ 600/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For<strong> SC / ST, OBC / BC / PH</strong>&nbsp;: <strong>₹ 400/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>Correction Charge : ₹ 500/-</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode (Online):</strong> You can make the payment using the following methods:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Debit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Credit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internet Banking</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">IMPS</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Cash Card / Mobile Wallet</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">RPSC School Lecturer (Special) Notification 2026 : Age Limits As On 01 January 2027</h5>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum Age : <strong>21 Years&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>40 Years&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>RPSC</strong> provides age relaxation for the <strong>School Lecturer (Special)&nbsp;position</strong> as per their regulations.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">121 Posts</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">RPSC School Lecturer (Special) Recruitment 2026 : Vacancy Details</h6>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 50px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 19.9923%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.0802%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>No. Of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 19.9923%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">RPSC School Lecturer (Special)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.0802%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">121 Posts</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"2\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;RPSC Statistical Officer Online Form 2025 : Eligibility Criteria&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.3201%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.6799%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.3201%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">RPSC School Lecturer (Special)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.6799%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have a&nbsp;<strong>Post Graduate degree</strong>&nbsp;or equivalent in&nbsp;<strong>English, Hindi, History, Political Science, Sociology, or Music,</strong>&nbsp;along with&nbsp;<strong>B.Ed. (Special Education) or B.Ed. with a 2-year Diploma in Special Education</strong>&nbsp;recognized by the Rehabilitation Council of India (RCI). Candidates should also have working knowledge of Hindi written in Devanagari script and&nbsp;<strong>knowledge of Rajasthani culture</strong>. Additionally, valid CRR registration with RCI before the examination date is mandatory.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #800000;\">You May Also Check :</span> <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/rssb-computer-instructor-2026/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">RSSB Computer Instructor Recruitment 2026</a></span></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;How To Fill RPSC School Lecturer (Special) Online Form 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Interested candidates who wish to apply for the <b>RPSC</b>&nbsp;post can submit their application online before <strong>30 June 2026.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Use the click here link provided below under important link section to apply directly.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Alternatively, visit the <strong>official website of RPSC</strong>&nbsp;to complete the application process online.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Make sure to complete the application before the deadline <a href=\"https://rpsc.rajasthan.gov.in/home\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>30 June 2026</strong></span>.</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ff0000;\">Note – छात्रो से ये अनुरोध किया जाता है की वो अपना फॉर्म भरने से पहले Official Notification को ध्यान से जरूर पढे उसके बाद ही अपना फॉर्म भरे । (<strong>Last Date, Age Limit, &amp; Education Qualification</strong>)</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;RPSC School Lecturer (Special) Recruitment 2026 : </span>Mode Of Selection&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><b>Written Examination</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Document Verification</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Medical Examination</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nb